<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kim Heonchang</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/822">822</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/9th-century">9th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kim Heonchang was a member of the Silla royal family and governor of Ungju, around present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gongju">Gongju</a>. Angered that his father had been passed over for the throne, in 822 he rebelled and proclaimed a new state called Jangan, winning support in several provinces. Royal forces crushed the revolt and he killed himself, but it showed how weak central power had become.</p></div>
